<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria raises main interest rate to 18 pct Mar 1.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria raises main interest rate to 18 pct Mar 1.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said on Thursday it would raise its central interest rate (CIR) to 18 percent monthly from 16.50 percent, effective next month.</p>
</text>
